  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ins 4301.02 Definitions.\n\n(a) \"Commissioner\" means the insurance commissioner.\n\n(b) \"Producer\" means a resident or non-resident producer pursuant to the provisions of RSA 402-J.\n\nSource. #8935, eff 8-1-07; ss by #10963, eff 10-26-15; ss by #14506, eff 2-7-26, EXPRES: 2-7-36",
